## 2. Three-Stage Processing Architecture

```text
[ data/raw/ Source Files ]
         │
         ▼  (Stage 1: Lossless Raw Ingestion)
[ stg_routes, stg_route_stops, stg_trips, stg_timetables, stg_passes ]
   - All columns preserved as text/native types
   - Source lineage and import_batch_id tagged
         │
         ▼  (Stage 2: Validation & Anomaly Flagging)
[ Staging Validation Procedures ]
   - Flag consecutive duplicates: is_consecutive_duplicate = TRUE
   - Flag cross-midnight trips: is_next_day_arrival = TRUE
   - Calculate coordinate distance deltas
   - Validate foreign key referential integrity
         │
         ▼  (Stage 3: Controlled Normalized Promotion)
[ Production Normalized Schema: routes, stations, route_stops, trips, passes ]
   - Clean column types and check constraints
   - Standard views include 100% of records
   - Optional deduplication views clearly labeled as approval-dependent
   - Indexed for low-latency FastAPI / Dograh calling queries
```

